<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Zaroori Soochna - Mataró Visit</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
body { font-family: 'Poppins', Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f5f7; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
.container { max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08); }
.header { background-color: #e52e2e; color: #ffffff; padding: 30px 20px; text-align: center; }
.header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 52px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; }
.header h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; }
.content { padding: 20px 25px 30px 25px; color: #333333; line-height: 1.6; }
.content p { margin: 0 0 18px; font-size: 15px; }
.greeting { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #e52e2e; margin-bottom: 15px !important; }
.alert-box { background-color: #fff0f0; border-left: 5px solid #e52e2e; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; text-align: center; }
.alert-box strong { color: #e52e2e; font-size: 18px; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; text-transform: uppercase; }
.alert-box p { color: #721c24; font-weight: 600; margin: 0; font-size: 15px; }
.contact-box { background-color: #f8f9fa; border: 1px solid #e9ecef; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin-top: 25px; text-align: center; }
.contact-box h3 { margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #1a1a1a; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; }
.contact-box a { color: #e52e2e; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
.footer { background-color: #fafafa; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #777777; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
<div class="header">
<h1>FLiiTS</h1>
<h2>ZAROORI SOOCHNA</h2>
</div>
<div class="content">
<p class="greeting">Namaste FLiiTER!</p>
<p>Aapko soochit kiya jata hai ki aane wale <strong>Budhvaar 9 September</strong> ko Mataró ke liye taiyare visited cancel kar di gayi hai.</p>
<div class="alert-box">
<strong>Dhyan Dein!</strong>
<p>Mataró mein FLiiTS ka koi bhi representative maujood NAHI hoga.</p>
<span style="font-size: 13px; color: #555; display: block; margin-top: 6px;">Kisi bhi sawaal ke liye aap aam channels dwara humse sampark kar sakte hain.</span>
</div>
<div class="contact-box">
<h3>Help Desk</h3>
<p>Kisi bhi prakriya ya sawaal ke liye, hum aapki madad <a href="mailto:hola@fliits.com">hola@fliits.com</a> par ya support chat par khushi se karenge.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="footer">
<p>Aapke sahyog aur samajh ke liye dhanyavaad.</p>
</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
